abstract: "Full infinite odd/even particle expansions of the anisotropic square-lattice bulk susceptibility at each fixed finite positive coupling ratio, all lattice separations, and every finite frontier point of the correct HT/LT complex domains. The terminal Lean uniform-field theorem explicitly takes PublishedRealSpinFormFactors and PublishedRealGibbsFields. Frozen C001 mathematics; author/metadata-only publication edition dated 24 October 2026."
